  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania: Tax and development support initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support is provided to Tanzania Revenue Authority in an effort to support the modernization of the tax administration and the expansion of the tax base. The objective is to enhance revenue mobilization to ensure more funds for poverty reduction purposes and to reduce the dependency on foreign funds in the long run. Donors (DK, UK and N) are providing support through the Tax Modernization Programme (TMP) basket fund.</narrative>
  </description>
